WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.058
Financial research begins with a question. EvidenceGraph helps you follow the answer back to its source.

2
00:00:07.298 --> 00:00:18.001
Bring SEC filings and annual company facts into one workspace. Add selected filings, or upload a PDF, HTML, or text document.

3
00:00:18.241 --> 00:00:29.198
Search indexed filing passages and open the evidence in context. Compare annual revenue, net income, and operating cash flow with the source fact and period visible.

4
00:00:29.438 --> 00:00:39.460
Keep the research question, findings, and caveats together. Export a Markdown note with citations, calculation details, and source links.

5
00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:50.823
Search uses lexical matching, and optional AI drafts need human review. EvidenceGraph supports research. Verify every source before relying on a result.
